@host = http://localhost:8080

### Prijava administratora
# @name admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@dermawise.rs", "password": "admin123"}

### Nadzor baze znanja: verzija, broj redova template-a, pravila po bazi i fazi sa izvorom i opisom, query-ji
GET {{host}}/api/admin/knowledge-base
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### Svi korisnici sa ulogama
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### Administrator dodaje dermatologa (pri ponovnom pokretanju 400 jer nalog postoji)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "dr.nikolic@dermawise.rs", "password": "derm456", "fullName": "dr Marko Nikolić", "role": "DERMATOLOGIST"}

### Prijava dermatologa
# @name derm
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "dermatolog@dermawise.rs", "password": "derm123"}

### Dermatolog nema pristup administraciji, 403
GET {{host}}/api/admin/knowledge-base
Authorization: Bearer {{derm.response.body.token}}
